  "data": "<a class=\"content-block2 hub-block full \n    \"\n  href=\"/comm-link/transmission/21432-Star-Citizen-Monthly-Report-October-2026\"  data-original_class=\"full\"\n>\n    <div class=\"type post\"><div class=\"icon\"></div><span>post</span></div>\n  <div class=\"background\" style=\"background-image:url('https://media.robertsspaceindustries.com/7i8kcecisn2xb/channel_item_full.jpg');\"></div>\n  <div class=\"title-holder\">\n    <div class=\"title trans-opacity trans-03s\">Star Citizen Monthly Report: October 2026</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text\">\n    <div class=\"comments\">0</div>\n    <div class=\"time_ago\">Posted: <span class=\"value\">4 hours ago</span></div>\n    <div class=\"section\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"over trans-opacity trans-02s\">\n    <div class=\"scroller trans-03s\">\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <p>Welcome to October’s PU Monthly Report! Last month was a busy one, with teams making significant progress across locations, characters, AI behaviors, backend technology, and much more. Read on for the latest details of everything done toward the recent and upcoming patch releases.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"corner corner-top-left\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner corner-top-right\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner corner-bottom-left\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner corner-bottom-right\"></div>\n</a>\n  <a class=\"content-block2 hub-block one_third \n    \"\n  href=\"/comm-link/transmission/21422-Roadmap-Roundup-November-4-2026\"  data-original_class=\"one_third\"\n>\n    <div class=\"type post\"><div class=\"icon\"></div><span>post</span></div>\n  <div class=\"background\" style=\"background-image:url('https://media.robertsspaceindustries.com/5nw60s8x71rw5/channel_item_full.png');\"></div>\n  <div class=\"title-holder\">\n    <div class=\"title trans-opacity trans-03s\">Roadmap Roundup - November 4, 2026</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text\">\n    <div class=\"comments\">0</div>\n    <div class=\"time_ago\">Posted: <span class=\"value\">5 hours ago</span></div>\n    <div class=\"section\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"over trans-opacity trans-02s\">\n    <div class=\"scroller trans-03s\">\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <p>With the Roadmap just updated, here is a brief explanatory note to give you insight into the decision-making that led to any changes.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"corner corner-top-left\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner corner-top-right\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner corner-bottom-left\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner corner-bottom-right\"></div>\n</a>\n  <a class=\"content-block2 hub-block two_thirds \n    \"\n  href=\"/comm-link/transmission/21311-November-2026-Subscriber-Promotions\"  data-original_class=\"two_thirds\"\n>\n    <div class=\"type post\"><div class=\"icon\"></div><span>post</span></div>\n  <div class=\"background\" style=\"background-image:url('https://media.robertsspaceindustries.com/v71fd57hyusmd/channel_item_full.jpg');\"></div>\n  <div class=\"title-holder\">\n    <div class=\"title trans-opacity trans-03s\">November 2026 Subscriber Promotions</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text\">\n    <div class=\"comments\">0</div>\n    <div class=\"time_ago\">Posted: <span class=\"value\">1 day ago</span></div>\n    <div class=\"section\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"over trans-opacity trans-02s\">\n    <div class=\"scroller trans-03s\">\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <p>It’s safe to say it’s been a busy few weeks in the world of Star Citizen following   \nthe recent releases and Squadron 42 news, and November’s only bringing more   \naction with the Intergalactic Aerospace Expo. Before things heat up again, take a  \nwell-deserved breather courtesy of the galaxy’s masters of meditation with this   \nmonth’s Flair. The Xi’an theme continues with November’s esoteric Ships of the   \nMonth, too. </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"corner corner-top-left\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner corner-top-right\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner corner-bottom-left\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner corner-bottom-right\"></div>\n</a>\n  "
}
